        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: 101 Dalmatians (1996 film), G-Force\n- People: Dodie Smith, Cruella de Vil\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures, Jerry Bruckheimer Films\n- Concepts: The Hundred and One Dalmatians, Disney film adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- Dodie Smith wrote the 1956 novel The Hundred and One Dalmatians.\n- Cruella de Vil appeared in Dodie Smith's 1956 novel The Hundred and One Dalmatians.\n- 101 Dalmatians is a 1996 American live-action comedy adventure film based on Disney's 1961 animated adaptation of Dodie Smith's 1956 novel The Hundred and One Dalmatians.\n- Cruella de Vil is the main antagonist in Disney's animated film adaptations 101 Dalmatians and in Disney's live-action film adaptations 101 Dalmatians and 102 Dalmatians.\n- G-Force is a 2009 American family comedy adventure film produced by Walt Disney Pictures and Jerry Bruckheimer Films.",
